{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CombatState","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CombatState","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:12GnustoEngine11CombatStateV","role":"symbol","title":"CombatState","modules":[{"name":"GnustoEngine"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Represents the current state of an active combat encounter in the interactive fiction engine."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CombatState","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"CombatState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the central data structure that tracks information needed to manage","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turn-based combat encounters. It maintains the participants, progression, equipment, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"any special conditions or modifiers that affect the combat.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Combat-Flow-Integration","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Combat Flow Integration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The combat state is stored in the game’s global state under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GlobalID.combatState"},{"type":"text","text":" and is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"managed by the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameEngine"},{"type":"text","text":". When combat begins (either through player-initiated attacks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or enemy encounters), a new "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CombatState"},{"type":"text","text":" is created and stored. The state persists across"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"combat rounds until the encounter ends through victory, defeat, or escape."}]},{"anchor":"Usage-in-Combat-Systems","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Usage in Combat Systems"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Combat systems conforming to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CombatSystem"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol receive the current "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CombatState"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ActionContext"},{"type":"text","text":" and use it to make combat decisions. The state can be modified"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"between rounds to track progression, change weapons, or apply temporary effects."}]},{"anchor":"State-Persistence","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"State Persistence"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":" type, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CombatState"},{"type":"text","text":" can be serialized for save games, ensuring that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ongoing combat encounters persist across game sessions."}]},{"anchor":"Example-Usage","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example Usage"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Starting combat with a troll using a sword","let combatState = CombatState(","    enemyID: .troll,","    roundCount: 0,","    playerWeaponID: .sword",")"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/CombatState\/init(enemyID:roundCount:playerWeaponID:combatIntensity:playerFatigue:enemyFatigue:enemyWeaponID:)","doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/CombatState\/init(from:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/Co